abstract:
A model in a notebook has produced exactly zero value. This final topic covers everything between a fitted estimator and a running service: serialising the whole pipeline rather than the model, building an API, containerising it, the training/serving skew that causes most production failures, data and concept drift with KS and PSI monitoring, the retraining loop, and a checklist to run before anything goes live.}
